<view class="page" style="font-size:{{fontPx}}px"><view class="back" bindtap="back">‹ 返回上一步</view><view class="title">经营资料与认证</view><view class="notice">包含服装批发或零售经营范围即满足行业准入，不另要求证明是否为女装。仍需核对证照与填写信息，并经人工终审。</view>
<view class="panel" wx:if="{{supplier&amp;&amp;!user.verified&amp;&amp;!adminPending}}"><view class="card-title">{{applicationPending?'厂家资料已提交，待审核':'完成厂家入驻资料'}}</view><view>请提交：营业执照、至少30秒相机拍摄的场所视频、5张不同场所照片。</view><view class="notice">{{applicationPending?'申请已保存，仍须材料核验、人工审核及电话回访接通且信息一致；现在不会自动开通权限。':'请填写下方主体资料并上传真实文件。资料未通过时，仅可有限浏览公开内容。'}}</view><button class="secondary full-btn" bindtap="browsePublic">先浏览公开内容（权限有限）</button></view>
 <view class="panel" wx:if="{{!administrator&amp;&amp;!adminPending}}"><view class="field"><text class="field-label">公司 / 个体主体名称</text><input value="{{company}}" data-field="company" bindinput="input" placeholder="与营业执照一致"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">经营范围</text><textarea maxlength="-1" value="{{scope}}" data-field="scope" bindinput="input" placeholder="按营业执照实际内容填写"/></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="chooseLicense" loading="{{loading}}">上传营业执照图片</button><image wx:if="{{license.localPath}}" class="image-preview" src="{{license.localPath}}" mode="aspectFit"/><button wx:if="{{license}}" class="small-btn" data-kind="license" bindtap="previewMaterial" loading="{{previewingId===license.id}}">安全预览营业执照</button><view class="tiny">证照私有保存，仅供授权审核，不作为公开货源图片展示。</view><view wx:if="{{supplier}}"><view class="divider"></view><view class="card-title">厂家场所材料（必交）</view><view class="muted">档口、展厅、公司或车间的实际场所。请调用相机拍摄至少30秒视频，并提供5张不同场所照片，全部私有保存；不接受用客户填写的时长替代服务器核验。</view><button class="secondary full-btn" bindtap="chooseVenueVideo" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}">拍摄至少30秒场所视频（最长60秒）</button><video wx:if="{{venueVideo.localPath}}" src="{{venueVideo.localPath}}" controls="{{true}}" style="width:100%;margin-top:20rpx"/><button wx:if="{{venueVideo}}" class="small-btn" data-kind="video" bindtap="previewMaterial" loading="{{previewingId===venueVideo.id}}">安全预览场所视频</button><view wx:if="{{venueVideo}}" class="tiny">视频已私有上传：{{venueVideo.name||venueVideo.id}}。设备报告时长：{{venueVideo.clientDuration||'未提供'}} 秒；由服务端ffprobe核验真实时长。</view><button class="secondary full-btn" bindtap="chooseVenuePhotos" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}">上传场所照片（已选{{venuePhotos.length}}张，仅5张）</button><view class="grid" style="margin-top:20rpx"><view wx:for="{{venuePhotos}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><image wx:if="{{item.localPath}}" src="{{item.localPath}}" mode="aspectFit" style="width:100%;height:220rpx"/><view wx:else class="tiny" style="padding:20rpx">已保存私有原件：{{item.name||item.id}}</view><button class="small-btn" bindtap="previewMaterial" data-kind="photo" data-index="{{index}}" loading="{{previewingId===item.id}}">安全预览</button><button class="small-btn" bindtap="removeVenuePhoto" data-index="{{index}}">移除第{{index+1}}张</button></view></view><view class="tiny">材料核验、人工审核及电话回访接通且信息一致后，才由平台决定是否开通厂家权限。</view></view><view class="error" wx:if="{{missingFields.length}}">待补齐：{{missingFields}}</view><button class="primary full-btn" bindtap="submit" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}">{{submittingCertificate?'材料核验中，请稍候…':'提交资质审核'}}</button></view>
 <view class="panel"><view class="card-title">经营资料</view><view class="muted">用于理解门店条件和推荐偏好，不替代资质审核。</view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">称呼</text><input type="text" value="{{profile.name}}" data-field="name" bindinput="profileInput" maxlength="80"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">店铺名称</text><input type="text" value="{{profile.shop}}" data-field="shop" bindinput="profileInput" maxlength="120"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">城市</text><input type="text" value="{{profile.city}}" data-field="city" bindinput="profileInput" maxlength="60"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">经营风格</text><input type="text" value="{{profile.style}}" data-field="style" bindinput="profileInput" maxlength="60"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">面积（平方米）</text><input type="digit" value="{{profile.area}}" data-field="area" bindinput="profileInput" maxlength="20"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">经营年限</text><input type="digit" value="{{profile.businessYears}}" data-field="businessYears" bindinput="profileInput" maxlength="20"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">主要客群年龄</text><input type="text" value="{{profile.customerAge}}" data-field="customerAge" bindinput="profileInput" maxlength="60"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">零售价格带</text><input type="text" value="{{profile.retailPriceBand}}" data-field="retailPriceBand" bindinput="profileInput" maxlength="80"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">经营需求（用顿号分隔）</text><textarea value="{{operationNeedsText}}" data-field="operationNeedsText" bindinput="input" maxlength="1600" placeholder="如：小单快返、支持并单"/></view><button class="secondary full-btn" bindtap="saveProfile" loading="{{savingProfile}}" disabled="{{savingProfile}}">保存经营资料</button></view>
 <view class="panel"><view class="card-title">公开联络设置</view><view class="muted">你明确同意后，平台才按身份、权益与联系权限向对方展示。可随时关闭；不会公开营业执照或登录手机号。</view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">用于联系的微信号</text><input value="{{publicContact.wechat}}" data-field="wechat" bindinput="contactInput" maxlength="100"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">公开联系电话（选填）</text><input type="text" value="{{publicContact.phone}}" data-field="phone" bindinput="contactInput" maxlength="30"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">联系二维码HTTPS地址（选填）</text><input value="{{publicContact.qrUrl}}" data-field="qrUrl" bindinput="contactInput" maxlength="2000" placeholder="仅填写你有权公开的二维码地址"/></view><view class="link-row"><text>我同意按平台权限展示以上联络信息</text><switch color="#254f4d" checked="{{publicContact.consent}}" bindchange="contactConsent"/></view><button class="secondary full-btn" bindtap="saveContact" loading="{{savingContact}}" disabled="{{savingContact}}">保存公开联络设置</button></view>
 <view wx:if="{{administrator||adminPending}}" class="notice">平台管理员身份由授权记录与本人微信/手机号绑定决定。前台身份与独立Web后台会话分开，不能在这里自行提升权限。</view><view class="panel"><view class="card-title">手机号授权验证</view><view class="muted">此能力需要已认证的相应小程序主体和后台配置。与开发演示登录不同。</view><button class="secondary full-btn" open-type="getPhoneNumber" bindgetphonenumber="phone">授权验证手机号</button></view>
 <view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{notice}}">{{notice}}</view>
 <view class="section-title">审核进度</view><view class="panel" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id"><view class="between"><view class="card-title">{{item.company}}</view><text class="badge">{{item.status}}</text></view><view class="muted">{{item.scope}}</view><view class="tiny">{{item.reason||item.note||'等待审核处理'}}</view><view class="notice"><view>人工审核：{{item.status}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.missingMaterialsText}}">缺项：{{item.missingMaterialsText}}</view><block wx:if="{{item.isSupplierApplication}}"><view>视频核验：{{item.videoStatusText}}</view><view>电话回访：{{item.phoneReviewText}}</view></block><view>{{item.ocrStatusText}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.precheck.jobId}}" class="tiny">任务：{{item.precheck.jobId}}</view><block wx:if="{{item.precheck.extracted}}"><view>识别主体：{{item.precheck.extracted.companyName||'未识别'}}</view><view>识别范围：{{item.precheck.extracted.businessScope||'未识别'}}</view><view>{{item.consistencyText}}</view></block><view wx:if="{{item.precheck.error}}">{{item.precheck.error.message}}</view><view class="tiny">AI仅辅助识别与一致性提示，不判断真伪；最终仍由人工审核。</view><button class="small-btn" bindtap="load">刷新预审状态</button></view></view>
</view>
